own ideas, feel free to reach out to me via my social media accounts.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:45:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688821","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4410640-1830797770236968","game_id":"steam-4410640","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.1","summary":"First of all, thank you for trying out the demo. The Crimson Broadcast demo has reached over 1,000 downloads in its first week. This level of interest is a great source of motivation for me to keep improving the game.With this update, the following features have been added:1. TurretThe turret is a rare item that can be found in the market and placed on the map by the player. Once deployed, it remains active for 60 seconds. After it expires, it disappears and is returned to the inventory after 15","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-24T17:37:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770236968","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4410640-1829528821303086","game_id":"steam-4410640","kind":"announcement","title":"Crimson Broadcast Overview","summary":"Although Crimson Broadcast is still in the early stages of development, most of its core mechanics are ready and it will be released as an alpha soon. Therefore, I decided to explain the features in this article to help players avoid confusion.Basically, the game tasks us with protecting a post-apocalyptic radio station, and every time the station is activated, it attracts creatures. The waves continue until the character dies, with each wave becoming faster and stronger.Let’s start with the ski","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-08T